      "puzName": "5eff7e75",
      "background": "cutscenes/road-taylor.webp",
      "speaker": "lam",
      "dialogue": "You’ve been such a great host. And I’ve really liked spending time with you while I can. God, this morning the breakfast was *so* good.",
